],"rationale":"《南齊書》卷四十四稱高宗遣左右單景雋宣旨。卷四十與《南史》卷二十四均見明帝左右單景雋，三處具同一罕見姓名、朝代和親近職掌。沿用卷四十既有人物識別。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p002","text":"先是王敬則事起，南康侯子恪在吳郡，高宗慮有同異，召諸王侯入宮。晉安王寶義及江陵公寶覽等住中書省，高、武諸孫住西省，勑人各兩左右自隨，過此依軍法，孩抱者乳母隨入。其夜太醫煮藥，都水辦數十具棺材，須三更當悉殺之。子恪奔歸，二更達建陽門刺啓。時刻已至，而帝眠不起，中書舍人沈徽孚與帝所親左右單景雋共謀少留其事，須臾帝覺，景雋啓子恪已至，驚問曰：「未邪？」景雋具以事荅。明日悉遣王侯還第。建武以來，高、武王侯居常震怖，朝不保夕，至是尤甚。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p002:m0002","surface":"王敬則","start":2,"end":5,"person_id":"7a0_95e_c4a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p002:m0011","surface":"子恪","start":11,"end":13,"person_id":"ijh_3fs_6u2_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p002:m0034","surface":"寶義","start":34,"end":36,"person_id":"w4m_9tw_147_C","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p002:m0040","surface":"寶覽","start":40,"end":42,"person_id":"98q_mll_d6v_BB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p002:m0104","surface":"子恪","start":104,"end":106,"person_id":"ijh_3fs_6u2_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p002:m0133","surface":"沈徽孚","start":133,"end":136,"person_id":"4cd_j3u_56v","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p002:m0142","surface":"單景雋","start":142,"end":145,"person_id":"wbo_1n5_vgq","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zhaozhou:p002:m0157","surface":"景雋","start":157,"end":159,"person_id":"wbo_1n5_vgq","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id